@startuml
title Error Handling Sequence - Reservation-Backed Operation Entry Publication
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0

participant "Step Composition" as SC
participant "Error Handling Unit" as EHU
participant "OperationEntryPublisher" as Pub
participant "PublicationReservation" as Res
participant "ErrorHandlerResult[THandlingOperationEntry,TErrorHandlingContext]" as EHR

SC -> EHU : authorize invocation under Association
EHU -> Pub : reserve(handlingOperationAttemptIdentity)
Pub -> Res : grant ReservationGrant (Reserved)
Res --> EHU : PublicationReservation
EHU -> EHU : produce THandlingOperationResult
EHU -> Pub : publish(reservation, ErrorHandlingOperationEntry)
Pub -> Pub : atomic acceptance linearization point
Pub --> EHU : PublicationAccepted (Consumed)
Pub -> Pub : retain complete entry
EHU -> EHR : assemble operation entries
EHR --> SC : ErrorHandlerResult aggregate
SC -> SC : integrate as optional errorHandlerResult
of StepExecutionResult[TOutput]

note right of Pub : Atomic acceptance: entry retained iff reservation Consumed
No partial acceptance
Reservation states: Reserved -> Consumed/Released

@enduml